      "Standard valid/ready handshake protocol on all stream interfaces.",
      "Input data width is 8 bits.",
      "The accumulator continuously adds joined samples to a running sum.",
      "The stream_stage provides one pipeline register stage.",
      "Active-low synchronous reset throughout."
    ]
